    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this stunning 4 bed, 2.5 bath, 3 story, semi detached, modern home. Presented in showhouse condition throughout. Boasting an A3 BER rating. Set on a quiet residential street with off street private parking.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises; entrance hall, guest wc, living room, kitchen / dining room and utility room. On the first floor there are three bedrooms, a family bathroom and a compact study/home office. On the second (/top) floor there is a further 2 bedrooms, one with an ensuite. The property further benefits from a private, low maintenance rear garden with a gated side entrance. \n\nThe location is excellent. Set in a modern, new development that is very well-finished and landscaped including green areas and a playground. Set close to all local amenities including schools, shops, parks, and public transport including bus & DART giving a great link to & from Dublin City Centre. The M1/M50 road network is close by as well as Dublin Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.1m x 5.7m\nWelcoming entrance hall featuring tiled flooring and a practical cloakroom\n\nLiving Room - 3.7m x 4.6m\nBright and spacious living room featuring solid French oak flooring, decorative coving, an electric fireplace, TV point, and a large front-facing picture window\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.4m x 4.9m\nWell-appointed kitchen/dining room featuring a fitted kitchen with a range of integrated appliances including a double oven, hob, extractor fan, microwave, dishwasher, and fridge/freezer. Finished with tiled flooring and a tiled splashback, while French doors open onto the rear garden\n\nUtility Room - 2.2m x 2.9m\nSpacious utility room featuring tiled flooring, fitted shelving, and is plumbed for a washing machine\n\nGuest WC - 1.4m x 1.6m\nGuest WC featuring tiled flooring, a wash hand basin, WC, and a heated towel rail\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 0.9m x 4.6m\nSpacious landing area featuring solid French oak flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.0m x 3.7m\nGenerous double bedroom spanning the full width of the property, featuring solid French oak flooring, a TV point, and two front-facing windows\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.7m x 4.8m\nDouble bedroom to the rear, featuring solid French oak flooring and built-in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.25m x 4.7m\nDouble bedroom to the rear, featuring solid French oak flooring and built-in wardrobes\n\nOffice - 2.1m x 1.0m\nCompact office space featuring solid French oak flooring\n\nBathroom - 1.7m x 2.9m\nFully tiled family bathroom featuring a bath, separate walk-in shower, WC, wash hand basin, and a heated towel rail.\n\nSecond Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.0m x 4.6m\nMain bedroom spanning the full width of the property, featuring carpet flooring and two built-in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 1.6m x 2.3m\nFully tiled ensuite with tiled flooring, wc, wash hand basin, heated towel rail and a walk in shower.\n\nOffice/Playroom/Study - 5.0m x 4.6m\nGenerous to the rear spanning the full width of the property Featuring carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes with an integrated dressing table, a TV point, and a practical cloakroom.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nThe front garden is fully paved and provides valuable off-street parking for up to two cars\n\nRear Garden - \nThe fully enclosed rear garden has been recently landscaped and features a newly paved patio area, graveled sections, a neat lawn, and flowerbed providing an attractive and low-maintenance outdoor space. Additional benefits include a side gated entrance and a garden shed with bike storage and fitted worktops.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>4 bed, 2.5 bath, 3 story, Semi Detached</li><li>BER: 'A2'</li><li>Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li>South West Facing Rear Aspect</li><li>uPVC Double Glazed Windows</li><li>Composite Front Door</li><li>Off street parking</li><li>Solar panels </li><li>Great condition</li><li>Built c. 2017</li><li>Approx 162.3 sqm / 1747 sqft</ul>"
      },
